@startuml
 title dep — Outbound local collector
 node "GitHub" {
 artifact "HappiHub repository" as Repo
 node "Disposable hosted test runners" as Tests
 artifact "Exact-SHA coverage" as Reports
 }
 node "Owner local machine" {
 artifact "Fixed collector and local queue" as Collector
 node "Disposable non-root scanner" as Scanner
 node "Existing SonarQube" as Sonar
 database "Existing PostgreSQL" as DB
 }
 Repo --> Tests
 Tests --> Reports
 Collector --> Repo : outbound HTTPS metadata and source
 Collector --> Reports : outbound HTTPS artifact retrieval
 Collector --> Scanner : validated data and trusted configuration
 Scanner --> Sonar : dedicated internal same-host network
 Sonar --> DB
 note bottom of Scanner
No host home or Docker socket mount
Narrow local HTTP exception owner-approved
end note
@enduml
